{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftml\/earlystoppingcallbacks"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/EarlyStoppingCallbacks"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides & Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/SupervisedClassifiers","doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/SupervisedRegressors","doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/EnsembleLearning","doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/HistogramGradientBoosting","doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/ReproducibilityAndPRNG","doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/MLOpsExport"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials"}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Early Stopping & Generalization Control","roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"SwiftML"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Training Callbacks","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/EarlyStopping","doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/MetricDirection"],"anchor":"Training-Callbacks"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Iterative estimators like multi-layer perceptrons (","type":"text"},{"code":"MLPClassifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"MLPRegressor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and gradient boosted decision trees (","type":"text"},{"code":"GradientBoostedTreesRegressor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") improve their training loss over successive iterations. However, after sufficient capacity has been fit, additional epochs frequently lead to overfitting on training noise and deteriorating generalization on unseen data.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"EarlyStopping","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides a decoupled, value-type training callback that monitors validation loss or performance metrics across successive epochs, halting training and optionally restoring optimal model weights.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Mechanics--State-Machine","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Mechanics & State Machine"},{"code":["Epoch Evaluation (Score S_t)","            │","            ▼"," Is (Best - S_t) > minDelta?","   ├── YES ──► Reset wait = 0, update bestScore = S_t, checkpoint weights","   └── NO  ──► Increment wait = wait + 1","                 │","            Is wait >= patience?","              ├── YES ──► shouldStop = true, restore best checkpoint weights","              └── NO  ──► Continue training"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Configuration-Parameters","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Configuration Parameters"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"patience","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Number of consecutive non-improving evaluations tolerated before triggering an early halt.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"minDelta","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Minimum absolute improvement required to qualify as progress.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"direction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":".minimize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for loss functions (cross-entropy, MSE) or ","type":"text"},{"code":".maximize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for scoring metrics (accuracy, R2, AUC).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"restoreBestWeights","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": When ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", automatically restores the model parameters from the epoch that achieved ","type":"text"},{"code":"bestScore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", avoiding overfit tail iterations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Example-Usage","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example Usage"},{"code":["import SwiftML","","\/\/ 1. Configure early stopping callback","let es = EarlyStopping(","    patience: 5,","    minDelta: 1e-4,","    direction: .minimize,","    restoreBestWeights: true",")","","\/\/ 2. Fit MLP with validation monitoring","let mlp = MLPClassifier(hiddenLayerSizes: [32, 16], maxIter: 200)","try await mlp.fit(","    features: X_train,","    targets: y_train,","    validationFeatures: X_val,","    validationTargets: y_val,","    earlyStopping: es",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Halt iterative training dynamically when validation performance ceases to improve to prevent overfitting."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://SwiftML/documentation/SwiftML/SupervisedClassifiers":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/SupervisedClassifiers","abstract":[{"text":"Train classification models using LogisticRegression, DecisionTreeClassifier, RandomForestClassifier, and MLPClassifier.","type":"text"}],"title":"Supervised Classification Models","url":"\/documentation\/swiftml\/supervisedclassifiers","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://SwiftML/documentation/SwiftML":{"type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swiftml","kind":"symbol","title":"SwiftML","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Supervised Machine Learning Estimators & Neural Networks."}]},"doc://SwiftML/documentation/SwiftML/MLOpsExport":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftml\/mlopsexport","type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Exporting Models to Core ML and ONNX","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftML\/documentation\/SwiftML\/MLOpsExport","abstract":[{"text":"Export trained SwiftSci estimators to native Apple Core ML (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".mlmodel"},{"text":") and cross-platform ONNX (","type":"text"},{"t